exports[`diagnostic registry > keeps stable complete allowed categories and meanings 1`] = `
[
  "PUI1001:unsupported-input/invalid-input — Static type/source graph could not resolve or check the authored type. Also emitted as invalid-input from explicit-category reject sites in parser-module.ts.",
  "PUI1002:unsupported-input/invalid-input — Local declaration or binding conflicts with the module namespace. Also emitted once as invalid-input from parser-module.ts for a duplicate-export boundary.",
  "PUI1003:invalid-input/unsupported-input — Import boundary: unsupported specifier, import kind, or a file/root/closed-source read failure. rejectNode call sites without an explicit category default to unsupported-input; the explicit-category boundary sites dominate the registered meaning.",
  "PUI1004:unsupported-input — Syntax outside the admitted static subset (async/generator/computed names/effectful expressions).",
  "PUI1005:unsupported-input — Duplicate declaration or binding within the module source.",
  "PUI1006:unsupported-input — Authored value or part violates its type or is not renderable under the family boundary.",
  "PUI1007:unsupported-input — Captured/callback value violates the immutable data boundary.",
  "PUI1008:unsupported-input — Export/import binding fails the declared surface contract.",
  "PUI1020:unsupported-input — Static type resolution fails: absent graph node, cyclic/ambiguous export, or non-finite shape.",
  "PUI1021:unsupported-input — Context declaration fails: non-literal key, non-createContextKey origin, or non-record value type.",
  "PUI1024:unsupported-input — Static rule declaration requires one checked declaration.",
  "PUI1025:unsupported-input — Static/Module declaration fails: duplicate field, non-factory value, or non-JSON value.",
  "PUI1999:compiler-defect — Unexpected internal failure past the admitted input boundary; original stack is preserved.",
  "PUI2001:invalid-ir — Private IR schema version is not supported by this compiler.",
  "PUI2002:invalid-ir — Generated IR violates its private schema.",
  "PUI2024:invalid-ir — Rule plan failed to lower a declared rule into the target contract.",
  "PUI3001:invalid-input — Reserved/invalid generated component identifier in the emitted profile.",
  "PUI3002:output-conflict — Artifact publication failed; the primary diagnostic is an output conflict (rollback reported).",
  "PUI3003:output-write — Artifact publication failed; the primary diagnostic is not a conflict (rollback reported). Non-conflict sibling of PUI3002 at artifact-output.ts:570, where the only non-conflict category in the declared union is output-write.",
  "PUI3004:invalid-input — Artifact output could not be planned or the produced artifact set could not be committed.",
  "PUI3005:compiler-defect — Emitter source-map attachment failed.",
  "PUI3301:unsupported-input — Web-component source emission rejected the input.",
  "PUI3302:unsupported-input — Web-component public surface has an unsupported member/property.",
  "PUI4001:unsupported-input/invalid-input — Profile or target is not implemented/admitted; also used by watch for unreadable project.",
  "PUI4002:unsupported-input — Requested profile version or native watch path is not admitted.",
  "PUI4003:unsupported-input/compiler-defect — Public method/interaction signature cannot cross the portable data boundary. Also emitted as compiler-defect when a watch compiler invocation throws; the failed revision retains only explicitly old output.",
  "PUI4004:unsupported-input/compiler-defect — Operation or requested capability is unavailable in the selected profile. Also emitted as compiler-defect when a watch report consumer callback throws; the watch closes and reports the original exception.",
  "PUI4006:unsupported-input — Authored hook has no semantic body, or a recursive hook is rejected.",
  "PUI4007:invalid-input/unsupported-input — Component identifier is reserved/invalid (Vue name check). The same code also reports a context-scope requirement at targets.ts:747 as unsupported-input.",
  "PUI4008:unsupported-input — Requested props-update policy or capability override is not admitted.",
  "PUI4009:unsupported-input — Native shader declaration fails graph validation or static lowering, or combines Shader and Presence without an admitted atomic material profile.",
  "PUI4101:invalid-input — Project source/manifest entry is not a valid project.",
  "PUI4102:unsupported-input — Vue2 profile rejects the emitted public surface.",
  "PUI4201:invalid-input/invalid-ir/unsupported-input — Compiler library manifest or artifact input is invalid. Also emitted as invalid-ir from style-plan.ts when a style contribution cannot be projected, and as unsupported-input when nominal DOM library linking is requested for a non-DOM source profile.",
  "PUI4202:invalid-input/unsupported-input — Style plan could not be applied to the library surface. Also emitted as unsupported-input from style-plan.ts for an unsupported style contribution.",
  "PUI4203:invalid-input — Compiler library artifact inventory/linking is incomplete or colliding.",
  "PUI4204:invalid-input — Linked declaration contract differs from the exported surface.",
  "PUI5001:output-conflict — A produced artifact conflicts with an existing destination or output constraint.",
  "PUI9001:invalid-input — CLI invoked with a missing/invalid input.",
  "PUI9002:compiler-defect — CLI surface hit an unexpected internal failure.",
  "PUI_FLUTTER_NAME:invalid-input — Flutter profile requires an uppercase Dart component identifier.",
  "PUI_GPUI_A11Y_VALUE:unsupported-input — GPUI SetValue requires its default route or a literal nonempty host:* event route.",
  "PUI_GPUI_CONTROL_LABEL_ANATOMY:unsupported-input — GPUI ControlLabel supports direct instance references, not anatomy-derived pairing.",
  "PUI_GPUI_EXCEPTION_PROPERTY:unsupported-input — GPUI rejects an exception/property payload.",
